{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26125","headline":"金谷园花发怀古 · 侯冽","name":"金谷园花发怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金谷千年後，春花发满园。\n红芳徒笑日，穠艳尚迎轩。\n雨湿轻光软，风摇碎影翻。\n犹疑施锦帐，堪叹罢朱纨。\n愁态莺吟涩，啼容露缀繁。\n殷懃问前事，桃李竟无言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"侯冽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26125.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26125","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}